{
  "description": "UI11c (D-115) privacy bucket controls, shared by web (bucket-controls.ts) and Android (BucketControls.kt): the built-in icons a bucket may wear (or any short custom glyph, such as an emoji: up to custom_icon_max UTF-16 units, every code point non-ASCII), its colour swatches (any #RRGGBB is allowed), how many buckets an audience menu lists before folding the rest away, the Advanced notification ceiling fields in display order, and which values each field accepts. Notification semantics stay in chorus-core::notify; this is input and presentation only.",
  "icons": [
    "friends",
    "members",
    "heart",
    "lock",
    "globe",
    "chat",
    "journal",
    "front",
    "layers",
    "bell",
    "bookmark",
    "folder"
  ],
